    "text": "Two sources of equal emfs are connected in series. This combination is connected to an external resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>. The internal resistances of the two sources are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math>. If the potential difference across the source of internal resistance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math> is zero then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> will be",
